# shadcn/ui (Cursor mirror of rules/03-shadcn.md)

> Canonical source: `rules/03-shadcn.md`. If they differ, canonical wins.
> Site: https://ui.shadcn.com · Docs: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs

- Code distribution, not a black-box library — you own the installed code.
- Init once: `npx shadcn@latest init` (creates `components.json` — never hand-create it).
- Discover FIRST (every task):
  - `npx shadcn@latest search <q>`
  - `npx shadcn@latest add <component>`
  - Read the docs page: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/<name>
- Use installed source's actual props/variants. Theme via CSS vars + Tailwind.
- Never hand-write a shadcn component from memory or copy from blogs.
- Never mix with Astryx on the same screen without explicit user approval.
- Cite the CLI command you ran in your response.
